{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/yubikit\/loggingguide"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"No setup is required. YubiKit defaults to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"debug"},{"text":" on stdout when compiled with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DEBUG"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"info"},{"text":" on stderr otherwise. You can override either default:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["import YubiKit","import Logging","","\/\/ Show warnings and errors.","YubiKit.Logs.configure(logLevel: .warning)","","\/\/ Use your preferred backend.","YubiKit.Logs.configure(logLevel: .debug) { label in","    StreamLogHandler.standardOutput(label: label)","}","","\/\/ Turn logging off.","YubiKit.Logs.configure { _ in SwiftLogNoOpLogHandler() }","","\/\/ Restore defaults.","YubiKit.Logs.configure()"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/apple\/swift-log","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"’s "},{"code":"Logging","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" product to your app target"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to use its backend types. Any SwiftLog "},{"code":"LogHandler","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" can be supplied by the factory."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each call replaces both settings. Omitting the factory restores YubiKit’s backend;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"omitting the level uses the selected handler’s level. Changes apply to existing sessions,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"though logs already in progress may use the previous settings."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"YubiKit’s configuration does not affect other libraries. To share your app’s backend,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pass its factory explicitly; global "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LoggingSystem.bootstrap"},{"type":"text","text":" does not select YubiKit’s backend."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Factories may run concurrently and must not log through YubiKit themselves."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Traffic logging","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Traffic-logging"},{"code":["YubiKit.Logs.configure(logLevel: .trace)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Raw traffic and SCP plaintext logs require "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"YubiKit to be compiled with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DEBUG"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Neither configuration nor a custom backend can enable them in other builds."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Custom connections are responsible for their own traffic logging."}]},{"name":"Warning","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Debug logs can include account names and credential identifiers."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Trace logs can include PINs, credentials, and cryptographic keys. Protect or redact logs before sharing them."}]}],"type":"aside","style":"warning"},{"anchor":"Custom-backends","level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Custom backends"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Labels identify categories, such as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.yubico.YubiKit.OATH"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.yubico.YubiKit.FIDO"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Metadata carries details such as byte counts and error codes; the default backend displays"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"these as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"key=value"},{"type":"text","text":" pairs. Message wording and metadata keys are not a stable API."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Your backend controls formatting, storage, and export. YubiKit does not retain log messages."}]}]}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Preparing your project","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/GettingStarted","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/Logs"],"anchor":"Preparing-your-project"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Choose YubiKit’s log level and backend with ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/Logs\/configure(logLevel:factory:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit"]]},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","title":"Logging","modules":[{"name":"YubiKit"}]},"kind":"article","sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/LoggingGuide","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://yubikit-swift.YubiKit/documentation/YubiKit":{"url":"\/documentation\/yubikit","title":"YubiKit","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Connect and run commands on the different applications on a YubiKey. The framework support connecting using NFC, Lightning and USB.","type":"text"}],"role":"collection","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"documentation-header.png"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit"},"doc://yubikit-swift.YubiKit/documentation/YubiKit/Logs/configure(logLevel:factory:)":{"abstract":[{"text":"Sets YubiKit’s log level and backend.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/yubikit\/logs\/configure(loglevel:factory:)","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.